menu "NODE-01 communication"
config NODE01_NETWORK_ENABLE
    bool "Enable provisioned Wi-Fi/MQTT (hardware/Broker NOT_RUN)"
    default n
    help
        Reads credentials from device NVS, never from committed sdkconfig.
        Requires node01_net strings: ssid, psk, uri, user, pass, site.
        Requires a reviewed, provisioned node01_id/last_boot u64 counter.
        Missing/corrupt state blocks publishing. No automatic NVS erase or ID seeding.
endmenu
